In the result, the following:
Smt Lakshminarasamma vs Sri.K N Venkataswamy on 17 November, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51992612/
3 ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part.
(ii) The impugned judgment and award passed by the Tribunal is modified;
